      "username": "IKerensky",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/i/df705f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-11-10T07:49:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We did it on Omnitron, followed next turn by Tachyon dual strike at 19+19... it was quite messy.</p><p>We go for the A solution because the card text say to deal \"deal each hero target X damage\", so we thought the damage to be calculated at before being applied to each hero individually, and as redirection doesnt recalculate the original damage...</p><p>The timing interraction is the most complicated part of this game. And is not always consistent with other card games ruling, wich is most infortunate.&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:17:32.939Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
